---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

// Career facts below come from Vincent's LinkedIn profile (17 Oct 2026).
// To complete before launch: employers and years behind "former CRO", education, languages, base city.
const principles = [
  { t: 'Operational mediation', b: 'When two leaders are stuck, the work is to mediate inside the real operating context, with the real trade-offs on the table.' },
  { t: 'Decision governance', b: 'Who decides what, by when and with which input. Clear answers shorten decision latency more than any amount of goodwill.' },
  { t: 'Board-ready agreements', b: 'Findings turn into written compacts between leaders that a board can read, track and hold the team to.' },
];
---
<Layout
  path="/about"
  type="ProfilePage"
  title="About Vincent Azé"
  description="Vincent Azé is Managing Partner at Kuma Partners, a former Chief Revenue Officer and, from 2017 to 2023, an independent executive advisor and leadership sparring partner."
>
  <section class="bg-linear-to-tr from-[#FAF8F4] via-[#F6F3EC] to-[#EBE6DB]">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-24">
      <p class="label text-teal-deep">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.08] text-ink max-w-[20ch] text-balance">Vincent Azé, Managing Partner at Kuma Partners.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-steel">I help founders and leadership teams of scale-ups, from Series A to C+, resolve executive friction and decision latency. Before that I was a Chief Revenue Officer, and for six years I worked as an independent executive advisor and leadership sparring partner.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-line" aria-labelledby="career-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-20 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-steel">Career</p>
        <h2 id="career-heading" class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink text-balance">From revenue leadership to leadership teams.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="mt-8 lg:mt-0 lg:col-span-8 divide-y divide-line-strong/70 border-y border-line-strong/70">
        <li class="py-6 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-teal-deep">Today</p>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink">Managing Partner, Kuma Partners</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-[60ch] leading-[1.7] text-steel">Kuma Partners is a professional services firm supporting executives through high-stakes inflection points. I work with Dr. Sven Mulfinger and the partner team on leadership diagnostics, offsites and executive advisory for scale-ups.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="py-6 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-teal-deep">March 2017 to February 2023</p>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink">Executive Advisor and Leadership Sparring Partner, independent practice</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-[60ch] leading-[1.7] text-steel">Worldwide, one-to-one with executives and with their leadership teams.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="py-6 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-teal-deep">Former role</p>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink">Chief Revenue Officer</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-[60ch] leading-[1.7] text-steel">Senior commercial leadership with responsibility for revenue.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-cream/70 border-y border-line/70" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-20">
      <p class="label text-steel">How I work</p>
      <h2 id="method-heading" class="mt-2 mb-10 font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink max-w-2xl text-balance">Inside the operating reality of the team.</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
        {principles.map((p) => (
          <div class="border-t border-line-strong pt-5">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-ink">{p.t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-[40ch] leading-[1.7] text-steel">{p.b}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-10 max-w-2xl leading-[1.7] text-steel">Kuma Partners does not sell long theoretical decks, junior-analyst research or detached one-to-one mindset coaching. The work happens with the leadership team, on the decisions they are facing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="public-heading">
    <div class="container-x py-12 lg:py-20 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-steel">Public work</p>
        <h2 id="public-heading" class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink text-balance">Writing, talks and the wider firm.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 lg:mt-0 lg:col-span-8 space-y-5 max-w-2xl leading-[1.7] text-steel">
        <p>Vincent writes about executive friction and decision latency on <a class="border-b border-ink text-ink" href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
        <p>On 11 November 2026 he co-leads a masterclass in Lisbon with Dr. Sven Mulfinger at PTW Palace during Portugal Tech Week: "When rapid scale stalls".</p>
        <p>Kuma Partners runs <a class="border-b border-ink text-ink" href={site.links.kuma} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the main firm site<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>, <a class="border-b border-ink text-ink" href={site.links.offsite} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">leadership offsites<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a> and <a class="border-b border-ink text-ink" href={site.links.round} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Round<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>, a peer advisory for founders and CEOs. Vincent's partner Dr. Sven Mulfinger advises executives one to one at <a class="border-b border-ink text-ink" href={site.links.sven} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mulfinger.com<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-navy text-paper">
    <div class="container-x py-14 lg:py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl max-w-[20ch] mx-auto text-balance">Bring the decision your team keeps circling.</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-paper text-navy px-8 py-4 text-sm hover:bg-cream transition-colors">Discuss a leadership challenge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
